\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TEY4cngWy-MQ7kNvwHRTcqb&_nc_oc=AdkOc-pAT3cKx6aOqeSaMKew9LG6W-Q_zmP9KMiGQw3FvwJRrCIt-DhZJPPlUbudH5E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvBJ7y0foUC8NIkCpa3gJpL1vrdvB_kU-wsq5_WVHqWRg&oe=69A96774"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XVlPAROfF_kQ7kNvwEtpb-o&_nc_oc=Adl1a_p8WqovOG0Ml0SZlAK3Tp0x03Ny2Efg4GjBWJHPOWIuiBOQfEpZThmik3IZ2vI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfthIa5hNx2JKnz_UEpt1JEMnTQGktyBfRC8zZK7hCchyg&oe=69A968D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qYW5Q4XFn-wQ7kNvwF4EZMS&_nc_oc=AdntA3lXKpAFeWjGGP_tMBMXfpmqysJ7qaXzKZvmr496LSR9uJA3zxBr_E6Xm9qqdrc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfugQOqvbXgJYm2gFNkfDxsqe1EK-RebL64bs-5lXQm-Tg&oe=69A97DF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771